## What is generated so far

This version of the template writes this README and `.copier-answers.yml` only. Terraform, dbt and Airflow code arrive in later template versions. Run `quicketl platform update` to pick them up.

## Change the platform

1. Edit `platform.yml`.
2. Run `quicketl platform validate`.
3. Commit your work, then run `quicketl platform update`. It applies the new spec and any template changes, and shows conflicts with your own edits for you to resolve.

Do not edit `.copier-answers.yml` by hand.
